    "text": "THIS IS A CLAIMS MADE AND REPORTED POLICY. “CLAIMS” MUST FIRST BE MADE AND REPORTED IN WRITING TO THE COMPANY DURING THE “CERTIFICATE PERIOD\" OR ANY APPLICABLE EXTENDED REPORTING PERIOD OF THIS POLICY, \"DEFENSE COSTS\" ARE PROVIDED IN ADDITION TO THE LIMITS OF LIABILITY, PLEASE READ THE POLICY CAREFULLY."
